# Safety net: never commit Delta / Parquet / Spark-warehouse artefacts that
# might leak into the test-resources tree (e.g. from an extractor or test
# misconfiguration). The legitimate TPC-DI fixtures under
# spark-ext/ivm-it/src/test/resources/tpcdi/ are CSVs + DDL/SQL/TSV text
# files only.
**/_delta_log/
**/_commits/
*.parquet
*.crc
**/.extractor-warehouse/
**/.extractor-coverage-warehouse/